{'symbol': 'POOL', 'date': '2022-02-25 16:05:00', 'title': 'POOL CORPORATION DECLARES QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND', 'text': 'COVINGTON, LA., FEB. 25, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- POOL CORPORATION (NASDAQ/GSM:POOL) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.80 PER SHARE. THE DIVIDEND WILL BE PAYABLE ON MARCH 24, 2022, TO HOLDERS OF RECORD ON MARCH 10, 2022.'}